  #line-at(379.15pt, 145.3pt, ".")
  #line-at(392.18pt, 145.3pt, "The organic solvents N-N, ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 166.05pt, "Dimethylformamide (DMF) and Acetone were purchased from University of Oklahoma chemical ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 186.8pt, "stock room. ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.025pt, 219.58pt, "2.2. Fabrication of the EG/Polymer composites ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.025pt, 252.33pt, "The fabrication procedure of the EG/PEID composite is illustrated in Fig. 2a. For EG/PEID ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 272.83pt, "composite preparation, required quantity of expandable graphite (0.125gm expandable graphite ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 293.6pt, "for 5wt% filler content EG/PEID composite of weight 2.5gm) was firstly placed into a furnace at ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 314.35pt, "900°C for approximately 30-60 sec in a crucible. EG so obtained was then dispersed into 20 mL ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 335.1pt, "DMAc. Separately PEID pellets were dissolved into 50 mL DMAc at 130 °C for 1 h. The DMAc ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 355.87pt, "solution with EG was mixed with polymer solution and blended for 3 h at 130 °C followed by a ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 376.37pt, "short time (~ 40 sec) probe sonication at 20% amplitude. The EG blended with polymer solution ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 397.12pt, "of ~25-30ml was cast into a petri dish. Lastly, the petri dish was kept at 100 °C for 24-48 h to ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 417.87pt, "produce the composite film. Likewise, 2.5 wt%, 7.5 wt%, and 10 wt% EG/PEID composite films ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 438.65pt, "were prepared using this same procedure. For comparison, the graphene-nanoplatelet (GnP)/PEID ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 459.15pt, "composite films were also prepared using the same solution casting technique for graphene with ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 479.9pt, "60 nm thickness of respectively.  ")
  #line-at(108.05pt, 512.67pt, "To prepare epoxy/expanded graphite composites, resin was added to 90 mL N-N, ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 533.42pt, "dimethylformamide (DMF) solution and stirred while heating at 150°C to obtain a homogeneous ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 554.17pt, "mixture. Expanded graphite was added to this solution and stirred for one hour. The solution was ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 574.67pt, "then tip sonicated for 40 seconds followed by stirring at 150°C until the solvent completely ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 595.45pt, "evaporated. After solvent evaporated, a thick mixture of EG/epoxy was obtained. This mixture ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 616.2pt, "was then spread over a PTFE sheet and kept in a vacuum oven at 140°C for 15 h to remove any ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 636.95pt, "residual solvent present in the mixture. On cooling the mixture to room temperature, hardener was ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 657.7pt, "added to it and mixed to obtain a homogenous viscous paste. This paste was then transferred to ")
  #line-at(72.025pt, 678.22pt, "aluminum molds and cured at 90°C for 20 h. ")
]

